#, python-format
msgid "in %(sites)s"
msgstr "in %(sites)s"

#. %(date)s is when this connection was last used, filled in by the browser.
#, python-format
msgid "last used %(date)s"
msgstr "zuletzt verwendet %(date)s"

msgid "less than a minute"
msgstr "weniger als eine Minute"

#. Translators: beside a subdomain or language that wasn't counted: how
#. many of the crawled pages link to it.
