msgstr "Subdomain"

msgid "text changed — counted from the crawl listed first"
msgstr "Text geändert — gezählt anhand des zuerst aufgeführten Crawls"

msgid "the server reached the most Markdown it keeps"
msgstr "Der Server hat die maximale Menge an Markdown erreicht, die er speichert"

#. Translators: in the README inside a Markdown download, after "Capture
#. stopped before the end of the crawl": the reason it stopped.
msgid "the server was running out of disk space"
msgstr "Dem Server ging der Speicherplatz aus."

msgid "this crawl reached the most Markdown one crawl may save"
msgstr ""
"Dieser Crawl hat die höchste Markdown-Menge erreicht, die ein Crawl "
"speichern kann."

msgid "vs."
msgstr "vs."

